    "summary": "The bearer can return to the battle, but only once per battle across your army. Only an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** model may take it.\n\nWhen the bearer is **destroyed**, roll a D6 as that phase ends. On a 2+, set it up again, **unengaged**, as near as it can be to the spot where it fell:\n\n- it stays outside any **attached unit**\n- its unit's **starting strength** is 1\n- it comes back with 3 wounds, or at full wounds if it was **battle-shocked** when destroyed",
